          <h3 id="safety-matrix">Item-by-item assessment</h3>
          <p>The 15 steps below are scored one by one. L and S are given as the grade followed by its rationale, so that every score can be traced back to the operation, the material and the control conditions it refers to. On a narrow screen the table scrolls sideways.</p>
          <div class="safety-table-scroll">
            <table class="safety-table safety-table--matrix">
              <caption>{{ safety.matrix.caption }}</caption>
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  {% for cell in safety.matrix.head %}<th scope="col">{{ cell }}</th>{% endfor %}
                </tr>
              </thead>
